<title>CANADA: Minister hopes CAW/CAI vote early next week.</title>
<headline>Minister hopes CAW/CAI vote early next week.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Transport Minister David Anderson said on Thursday he hoped that members of the Canadian Auto Workers union would vote on a plan to save Canadian Airlines Corp by Monday or Tuesday next week.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope the vote would be very soon and I hope (CAW president) Mr. Hargrove will cooperate in making sure it is very soon. By soon I mean Monday or Tuesday of next week, preferably Monday,&quot; Anderson told reporters outside the parliamentary chamber.</p>
</text>
